# c143r3_model.py output (stdlib only, deterministic); base = c143r2_base.py
# arms as in r2 (A, AJ, AJ2, G, C, CJ, CJ2); CK / CK2 = clue: bing with first new root
# txg = readable ring max + 1 + root slots yielding no readable root (rollback; CK2 also
# at every mount).  fs = faults per slot, fr = record copies per range.  *_slot_only =
# the same sweep restricted to scripts with no whole-disk fault at any scan

